    {"Speakers", "Lautsprecher", "Haut-parleurs", "Altavoces", "Altoparlanti", "スピーカー"},
    {"Stereo", "Stereo", "Stéréo", "Estéreo", "Stereo", "ステレオ"},
    {"5.1 surround", "5.1-Surround", "Surround 5.1", "Envolvente 5.1", "Surround 5.1", "5.1サラウンド"},
    {"Stereo mixes for two speakers or headphones. 5.1 surround mixes for six speakers and plays on as many as the "
