    {"Voice headroom", "Stimmen-Headroom", "Marge dynamique des voix", "Margen de las voces",
     "Headroom delle voci", "ボイスのヘッドルーム"},
    {"Lowers some sounds to leave room in the mix. Off plays every sound at full level, which changes the balance "
     "between music, voices and effects.",
     "Senkt manche Töne ab, um Platz im Mix zu lassen. Aus spielt jeden Ton mit voller Lautstärke, was das "
