    {"Sound filters", "Klangfilter", "Filtres sonores", "Filtros de sonido", "Filtri sonori", "サウンドフィルター"},
    {"Muffled or resonant sounds keep their filtering.", "Gedämpfte oder resonante Töne behalten ihre Filterung.",
