     "I suoni attutiti o risonanti mantengono il loro filtraggio.", "こもった音や共鳴する音のフィルターを維持します。"},
    {"Soft clipping", "Weiches Clipping", "Écrêtage doux", "Recorte suave", "Clipping morbido", "ソフトクリッピング"},
    {"When the mix gets too loud it is rounded off instead of cut flat, which crackles less.",
